    "description": "This watch face is exclusively designed for Wear OS devices with API 30+.\r\n\r\nFeatures :\r\n\u2022 Date and battery level indication with low battery warning light.\r\n\u2022 Hour digit changes color when on time, depending on color selection.\r\n\u2022 Smooth graphic background animation plays when the watch face is on.\r\n\u2022 Choose from 15 different color combinations.\r\n\r\nIf you encounter any problems or installation difficulties, please contact us  so we can assist you with the process.\r\n\r\nEmail:  support@creationcue.space",
